{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JON","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"約拿書","commonName":"約拿書","title":"約拿書","order":32,"numberOfChapters":4,"sha256":"f91d6b16eb9a5d63ebd94eb0437fbc5c9dbfa1e954ec315b49b5370c5c15f3ef","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JON/1.json","lastChapterNumber":4,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JON/4.json","totalNumberOfVerses":48},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和華第二次對約拿說："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["「你起身前往尼尼微大城，向那裡的居民宣告我先前吩咐你的話。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["約拿便照耶和華的吩咐前往尼尼微城。尼尼微城很大，要三天才能走遍。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["約拿進城走了一天，宣告說：「再過四十天尼尼微就要毀滅了！」"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["尼尼微城的人相信了上帝的話，便宣告禁食，所有的人，無論大小貴賤都披上麻衣。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["尼尼微王聽到這消息後，便走下寶座，脫下王袍，披上麻衣，坐在爐灰中。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["王又向全城頒佈通告，說：「王和大臣有令，所有的人都必須禁食，牛羊牲畜都不許吃草也不許喝水。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["人和牲畜都必須披上麻衣，眾人要向上帝懇切呼求，改邪歸正，停止作惡。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["上帝或許會心生憐憫，收回烈怒，使我們不致滅亡，也未可知。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["上帝看見他們改邪歸正，不再作惡，就心生憐憫，沒有像所說的那樣毀滅他們。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JON/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JON/4.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JON/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":10}